xxep ob c2 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=8.000 l=0.15 nf=2 m=1 ad=1.1600 as=2.3200 pd=8.580 ps=17.160
.ends
.subckt sspll_ckg_pulse_h in out VDD VSS
* RC pulser: out = in AND NOT(in delayed by the R-C stage), i.e. a pulse at every rising edge of in
xx1n inb in VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=0.420 l=0.15 nf=1 m=1 ad=0.1218 as=0.1218 pd=1.420 ps=1.420
xx1p inb in VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=0.840 l=0.15 nf=1 m=1 ad=0.2436 as=0.2436 pd=2.260 ps=2.260
