xx2p drc in VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=0.840 l=0.15 nf=1 m=1 ad=0.2436 as=0.2436 pd=2.260 ps=2.260
xr drc rc VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po_0p35 l=6.0 mult=1 m=1
