.subckt sspll_ckg_hlatch s r out VDD VSS
* NOR latch q = set by s, reset by r; out = q AND NOT s
xxl1na q r VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=0.840 l=0.15 nf=1 m=1 ad=0.2436 as=0.2436 pd=2.260 ps=2.260
